1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 18=

4
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,399
These scars...

5
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,119
I got them back then

6
00:00:53,399 --> 00:00:54,880
when I saved Zhang Haotian.

7
00:00:57,039 --> 00:00:58,960
I was willing to give him everything.

8
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:01,439
When I loved him the most,

9
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,959
he pushed me to the edge of death.

10
00:01:05,439 --> 00:01:06,200
Mai.

11
00:01:07,159 --> 00:01:08,280
It's not his fault.

12
00:01:09,359 --> 00:01:10,239
It's mine.

13
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:12,439
When I gave him my heart,

14
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:14,079
I never asked if he wanted it.

15
00:01:14,439 --> 00:01:15,799
I brought this upon myself.

16
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:17,319
I overestimated myself.

17
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:20,439
All this shame is something I deserved.

18
00:01:25,663 --> 00:01:30,000
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

19
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:30,840
Well,

20
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,480
do you want to hear

21
00:01:33,719 --> 00:01:35,280
about the Zhao Mai I know?

22
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:40,519
When I first met her,

23
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,439
I thought

24
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,040
she was beautiful.

25
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:48,239
Although she was cold toward me,

26
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,560
keeping me at arm's length,

27
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,400
everything she did

28
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:55,200
came from a genuine place.

29
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:59,120
I wanted to be her friend.

30
00:02:02,333 --> 00:02:04,159
That was back in our freshman year.

31
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,479
I even got mad at you.

32
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,560
We fought sometimes too.

33
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,319
But you know what?

34
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,759
Without you,

35
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:18,759
the day I fell from Zhang Haotian's car,

36
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:21,319
I would have died.

37
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,680
Without Zhao Mai,

38
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:28,240
I would never have known
such sincere affection.

39
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:31,520
Without Zhao Mai,

40
00:02:32,646 --> 00:02:34,080
after losing my mother,

41
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,639
I would never have felt
this warmth around me.

42
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:38,599
So,

43
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:41,400
to me,

44
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:43,400
Zhao Mai is the best family I have.

45
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:45,960
Thank you, Zhao Mai.

46
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:50,560
From now on, we'll be sisters.

47
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,120
(Mai,)

48
00:02:56,359 --> 00:02:58,079
(I've decided to go to Zhang Haotian.)

49
00:02:58,412 --> 00:02:59,412
(I'll infiltrate his side)

50
00:02:59,825 --> 00:03:01,385
(and gather stronger evidence.)

51
00:03:02,285 --> 00:03:02,845
(You...)

52
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:05,060
(don't have to worry about me.)

53
00:03:12,096 --> 00:03:15,416
(The samples confirm biological link
between Sample 1 and 2.)

54
00:03:21,919 --> 00:03:23,120
(Get me a paternity test.)

55
00:03:26,825 --> 00:03:27,466
Haotian.

56
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,360
(Air Conditioner;
Drainage Water)

57
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,120
What is it?

58
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,000
These two strands of hair.

59
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:35,840
One belongs to Zhao Ke,

60
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:36,919
and the other

61
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,759
belongs to Su Qinglan.

62
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,719
How is that possible?

63
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:45,759
Why did you think of doing
a paternity test on them?

64
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:48,360
Zhao Ke looks a lot like
my adoptive father, Zhang Yongren.

65
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:49,840
They look incredibly alike.

66
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,360
I was actually afraid she was Jiang Lai.

67
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,240
My fear blinded me.

68
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,159
I failed to notice it.

69
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,599
Then your adoptive father

70
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,439
and Su Qinglan...

71
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:04,759
They are lovers.

72
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,479
Zhao Ke isn't Jiang Lai.

73
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:10,319
She was abandoned by Su Qinglan.

74
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,840
She's Lin Lulu's half-sister.

75
00:04:17,805 --> 00:04:18,486
Haotian.

76
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:21,439
I still think this is...

77
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,279
Hello?

78
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,160
(I sent you my location.)

79
00:04:28,399 --> 00:04:29,240
(Come pick me up.)

80
00:04:46,052 --> 00:04:47,612
This apartment may be a little small,

81
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,560
but it's only temporary.

82
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,639
Once I divorce Lin Lulu,

83
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,839
we'll move abroad together.

84
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,079
You can decide

85
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,879
how big a house you want

86
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,399
and how to decorate it.

87
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:06,079
Didn't we just see each other yesterday?

88
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,399
Why are you still being so clingy?

89
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:10,040
Ke.

90
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,879
I know everything now.

91
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,160
Know what?

92
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,800
Zhang Yongren.

93
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,399
What exactly are you trying to say?

94
00:05:30,839 --> 00:05:32,240
He was my adoptive father.

95
00:05:33,252 --> 00:05:35,093
I met him when I was five.

96
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,399
I lost him when I was eight.

97
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:39,800
But he had another identity.

98
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,240
He was Su Qinglan's boyfriend

99
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,600
before she married Lin Lulu's father.

100
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,040
Zhang Yongren came from a poor family,

101
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,040
so the Su family forced them apart.

102
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,839
But back then,

103
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,759
Su Qinglan was already pregnant.

104
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,920
Zhang Yongren was beaten severely
by the Su family,

105
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:00,439
leaving him with lasting injuries.

106
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,800
He only survived for three more years.

107
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:06,759
He was dead because of Su Qinglan.

108
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:12,040
Mr. Zhang,

109
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:14,839
why are you telling me about
Su Qinglan's past relationships?

110
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:19,800
I had a paternity test done.

111
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:21,439
You and Su Qinglan

112
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:23,665
are mother and daughter.

113
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,519
When you approached Lin Lulu,

114
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:34,160
I always thought you were trying

115
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:36,000
to get revenge on Su Qinglan
for abandoning you.

116
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,399
I'm sorry.

117
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,319
I even suspected you.

118
00:06:50,652 --> 00:06:51,492
(Come with me.)

119
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:53,360
(Whatever you want to do,)

120
00:06:54,032 --> 00:06:55,112
(I'll do it for you.)

121
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,839
(So that's the truth.)

122
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,639
(But the paternity test...)

123
00:07:04,319 --> 00:07:06,120
Are you sure that Su Qinglan and I...

124
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,919
I am sure.

125
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:12,319
(No wonder my kidney matched Su Qinglan's.)

126
00:07:12,825 --> 00:07:13,546
(But...)

127
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:24,800
I don't feel well.

128
00:07:38,096 --> 00:07:40,096
(True Identity)

129
00:07:40,521 --> 00:07:44,819
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

130
00:07:45,627 --> 00:07:48,439
♪I should forget you♪

131
00:07:48,908 --> 00:07:53,985
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

132
00:07:54,009 --> 00:07:55,849
♪To carry on♪

133
00:07:56,105 --> 00:08:00,962
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

134
00:08:01,328 --> 00:08:03,216
♪You no longer have the strength♪

135
00:08:05,515 --> 00:08:08,396
♪You want me to go there for you♪

136
00:08:09,964 --> 00:08:15,402
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

137
00:08:15,996 --> 00:08:19,135
♪Your freedom♪

138
00:08:19,835 --> 00:08:24,266
♪Has become my cage♪

139
00:08:25,194 --> 00:08:30,985
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

140
00:08:32,336 --> 00:08:38,186
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

141
00:08:38,649 --> 00:08:44,596
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

142
00:08:44,876 --> 00:08:48,126
♪You told me♪

143
00:08:48,523 --> 00:08:53,029
♪I would shine like a star♪

144
00:08:53,873 --> 00:08:58,000
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

145
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:02,070
♪How to live without you♪

146
00:09:02,289 --> 00:09:08,114
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

147
00:09:09,635 --> 00:09:13,419
♪So hazy and blurred♪
